<body>
<h2 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;">接口控制文件示列</span></h2><p><br></p><h1><span style="font-family: 黑体;">1 范围</span></h1><p style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><h1><span style="font-family: 黑体;">2 引用文件</span></h1><p style="text-indent: 28pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><h1><span style="font-family: 黑体;">3 术语定义</span></h1><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;"><br></p><h1><span style="font-family: 黑体;">4 信息交联关系</span></h1><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;信息交联关系见</span><span style="font-size: 16px;">图1</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;"><br></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;"><div style="width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:4pt auto;"><img src="data:image/png;base64," style="display:block;max-width:9cm;max-height:12cm;object-fit:contain;height:auto;border:1pt solid #e6e6e6;padding:4pt;box-sizing:border-box;background:#fafafa;transform:rotate(90deg);transform-origin:center center;" alt="信息交联关系图" /></div></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">图 1 &nbsp;信息交换关系</span></p><p style="text-align: left;"><br></p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;"> &nbsp; &nbsp;系统</span><span style="font-size: 16px;">各部件</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">的</span><span style="font-size: 16px;">通信速率和通信周期</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">见</span><span style="font-size: 16px;">表</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体;">1所示</span><span style="font-size: 16px;">。</span></p><p><br></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">表</span>1<span style="font-family: 宋体;"> 部件通信速率及通信周期</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;"><p style="text-align: center;">（暂无通信数据）</p></span></p><p style="text-align: left;"><br></p><h1><span style="font-family: 黑体;">5 通信</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">要求</span></h1><h2><span style="font-family: 黑体;"> &nbsp; &nbsp;5.1 主要</span><span style="font-family: Arial;">数据类型</span><span style="font-family: 黑体;">说明</span></h2><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><h2><span style="font-family: 黑体;"> &nbsp; 5.2 </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">信息帧格式要求</span></h2><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><h2><span style="font-family: 黑体;"> &nbsp; 5.3 RS</span><span style="font-family: Arial;">422</span><span style="font-family: 黑体;">要求</span></h2><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><h2><span style="font-family: 黑体;"> &nbsp; 5.4 </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">以太网要求</span></h2><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><h2><span style="font-family: 黑体;"> &nbsp; 5.5 </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">帧类别与对应端口号</span></h2><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><h2><span style="font-family: 黑体;"> &nbsp; 5.6 节点号</span><span style="font-family: Arial;">定义</span></h2><p><span style="font-family: 宋体;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;……</span></p><h2><span style="font-family: 黑体;"> &nbsp; 5.7 异常情况处理</span></h2><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style="font-family: 宋体;">……</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><h2 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;">附录</span></h2><p style="text-align: center;">暂无协议数据</p><p><br></p>
